---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import {site} from '../data/site';
const {concept='field-guide'}=Astro.props;
const news=(await getCollection('news')).sort((a,b)=>(b.data.published?.getTime()??0)-(a.data.published?.getTime()??0)).slice(0,2);
---
<div class:list={['home',{'colony':concept==='colony'}]}>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Small globs. Big plans.</p><h1>Grow a colony.<br/><em>Find your strategy.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">A free, open-source real-time strategy game where you assign tasks and your globs get to work.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={site.appUrl}>Play in browser <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/downloads/">Download the game</a></div><p class="hero-note">Browser early access · Mouse & keyboard</p></div><figure class="hero-scene"><img src="/images/globulation2-match.webp" width="1000" height="562" alt="Globulation 2 match with turquoise globs, organic buildings, purple flags and resource paths across green terrain" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Meet your colony. Every glob has a job to do.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">A different kind of RTS</p><h2>Think in tasks.<br/>Watch a world come alive.</h2><p>Choose what needs doing, then let your globs handle the details. Shape an economy, train your colony, and decide where to push next.</p></section>
<section class="three-grid" aria-label="How you play"><article class="feature"><span class="number">01 / GROW</span><h3>Keep your colony thriving.</h3><p>Build inns, gather food, and balance the workers behind every new building.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="number">02 / PLAN</span><h3>Give direction, not every order.</h3><p>Assign workers and place flags. Your globs find their way to the work.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="number">03 / ADAPT</span><h3>Make the map your own.</h3><p>Explore, train, and choose where your colony should defend or advance.</p></article></section>
<section class="split-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your first colony starts here</p><h2>New to the world?</h2><p>Learn the rhythm of food, construction, and training before your first multiplayer match.</p><a class="text-link" href="/learn/">Open the player’s field guide →</a></div><div class="callout"><span class="eyebrow">Made to be shared</span><h3>Bring a friend.<br/>Build a community.</h3><p>Find other players, contribute an idea, or help bring the next chapter of Glob2 to life.</p><a class="text-link" href="/community/">Find your people →</a></div></section>
<section class="news-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">From the project</p><h2>News & notes</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/news/">All news →</a></div><div class="two-grid">{news.map(item=><a class="card" href={`/news/${item.id}/`}><span class="eyebrow">{item.data.published?.toLocaleDateString('en',{year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'})??'Project update'}</span><h3>{item.data.title}</h3><p>{item.data.description}</p><span class="text-link">Read the story →</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="closing"><p class="eyebrow">Your next move</p><h2>Let the globs get to work.</h2><a class="button" href={site.appUrl}>Play in browser ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/game/">Get to know the game →</a></section></div>
